  storyText: 哈哈哈，{FirstName}供奉。来这里少坐片刻，我已派人通知唐家，想必他们很快便到。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114855297397002957}
  AvatarIntID: 0
